  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MA Horticulture Production and Marketing Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Irrigated agriculture.Beneficiaries: 357 producers and 745 employees .Description: The project will improve access to inputs through revolving loan fund and strengthened access to bank loans to enable farmers to increase acreage and yields; establish solar-powered boreholes to increase cropping cycles and save on energy costs and provide a solar powered cold-room to store perishable produce and reduce post-harvest losses of fresh groundnuts and tomatoes. The assistance will improve the capacity of management to direct and control operations at MA through strengthening internal controls and establishing a business plan, policies and procedures, training in post-harvest handling and storage, enterprise planning, and corporate governance, agronomy and use of good agricultural systems and standards and financial literacy.</narrative>
  </description>
